party\u2019s appointment documents documents Appointment executed Appointment executed 96 | Guidance Part 2 Edition 6 - February 2021 Parties, teams and processes for the delivery phase of the assets Mobilization (19650-2 clause 5.5) (Getting the delivery team ready to go) Appointing party Lead appointed party Appointed party 5.5.1 5.5.1 Mobilize resources Mobilize resources 5.5.2 5.5.2 5.5.2 Mobilize information Mobilize information Mobilize information technology technology technology 5.5.3 5.5.3 Test the project\u2019s Test the project\u2019s information information production methods production methods and procedures and procedures 97 | Guidance Part 2 Edition 6 - February 2021 Parties, teams and processes for the delivery phase of the assets Collaborative Production of Information (19650-2 clause 5.6) (Work in progress and shared information) 5.6.1 Check availability of reference information and shared resources 5.6.2 Generate information 5.6.3 Undertake quality assurance check 5.6.4 5.6.5 Review information Information model and approve for review sharing 5.6.5 Information model review Next Information iteration weiver lufsseccusnU kcehc lufsseccusnU Lead appointed party Appointed party Shared information 98 | Guidance Part 2 Edition 6 - February 2021 Parties, teams and processes for the delivery phase of the assets Information Model Delivery (19650-2 clause 5.7) (Checking of information for publishing at an information milestone) To 5.6.1 To 5.6.1 To 5.6.1 Information Milestone Information 5.7.2 for publishing 5.7.1 Review Submit information and authorize the model for lead information appointed party model authorization Information for publishing 5.7.4 5.7.3 Review Submit information and accept the model for appointing information party acceptance model End of milestone detcejer ledom noitamrofnI detcejer ledom noitamrofnI Appointing party Lead appointed party Appointed party 99 | Guidance Part 2 Edition 6 - February 2021 Parties, teams and processes for the