s required before a transition can take place. \u2022 Controlled access at an information container level For example: the CDE solution and workflow can allow configuration that restricts access to information containers that have not reached a sufficient level of maturity or are too sensitive for specific organizations or individuals to have access to them ISO 19650-2 related clauses:", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.4 Establish the project\u2019s information standard", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.5 Establish the project\u2019s information production methods and procedures", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 4.6 Complete lead appointed party\u2019s appointment documents", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.2 Establish the project\u2019s information requirements", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.3 Establish the project\u2019s information delivery milestones", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.4 Establish the project\u2019s information standard", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.5 Establish the project\u2019s information production methods and procedures", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 3.2 Establish the delivery team\u2019s (pre-appointment) BIM execution plan", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.3 Establish the project\u2019s information delivery milestones", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Reinforced Concrete Beam. Process rule: 1.4 Establish the project\u2019s information standard", "[L123 Inference] YC-ST-SF-BIP uses YC-ST-SF-BIP Rei